<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Heftel a strong buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Heftel a strong buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Alex. Brown said it reinitiated coverage of Heftel Broadcasting Corp with a strong buy recommendation.</p>
<p>-- Shares shed 1/16 to 41 in morning Nasdaq trade.</p>
<p>-- Analyst Andrew Marcus was not immediately available to comment.</p>
